 ### Added
 
+- Experimental retry-aware logical output envelopes for Workflow Streams.
+  ``WorkflowStreamClient.logical_output_publisher`` emits fenced output
+  generations, and ``LogicalOutputReconstructor`` returns validated begin,
+  chunk, and terminal updates while checking sequence, content, terminal
+  receipt, and exact consumer acknowledgement. The OpenAI Agents
+  integration can opt in with
